  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<li data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1186\">\n<p data-start=\"1099\" data-end=\"1186\">Tumor cells show <strong data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1156\">[positive/negative] immunoreactivity</strong> for neuroendocrine markers.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1275\">\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1275\">Findings are <strong data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1237\">consistent with / supportive of</strong> <strong data-start=\"1238\" data-end=\"1272\">neuroendocrine differentiation</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1407\">\n<p data-start=\"1278\" data-end=\"1407\">Correlation with histomorphology and other ancillary tests (e.g., Ki-67, TTF-1, CK) is recommended for definitive classification.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
